      :outcomes [
        "Pruned text-to-speech dependencies from the runtime voice loop"
        "Engineered raw transcript ingestion from Parakeet-TDT-0.6B-v3 Multilingual supporting Russian and English"
        "Validated RTF < 0.05 streaming transducer performance"
      ]
